	(gr_text "L1  Signal   - component placement + BGA/fine-pitch escape (top)\nL2  GND      - solid, primary reference for L1 and L3\nL3  Signal   - BGA via-in-pad continuation + secondary digital routing\nL4  Power    - split pour: 5V / 3V3_DIG / 3V3_ANA (moated)\nL5  GND      - solid, reference for L6, return path for L4\nL6  Signal   - bottom: connectors, analog-sensitive routing, RS-485"
